What is the strangest but still believable link?
Which link is the strongest, and why?

Example starting point:
“People filming their desk setups.”

"People record themselves going to strangers and talking to them"

obvious link - people find it interesting to see reactions of people
cultural link - its not normal to do this
social link - Society is at its most antisocial its ever been
psychological link - People wish to be able to spark up a conversation with anyone


